 "_readme": [
  "Card scans TCGdex does not have. Checked by fetching every one of the 3,539",
  "tcgdex image urls the site emits, on 2026-08-14: these 101 answered 404.",
  "",
  "They are concentrated in promo sets nobody scanned: Sun & Moon Black Star",
  "Promos, the e-Card series, TCGP P-A and a few Japanese sets.",
  "",
  "WHY THIS FILE EXISTS. Every one of these images carries onerror=this.remove(),",
  "so nothing looked broken: the picture silently vanished and left a gap in the",
  "tile, at the cost of a dead round trip each. Skipping them up front costs",
  "nothing and renders the same tile without the gap.",
  "",
  "Entries are image BASES, so both /low.webp and /high.webp are covered.",
  "Re-check with a sweep if TCGdex backfills; an entry here that starts working",
  "again only costs us one missing picture, which is why it is safe to be stale."
